    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Percentage of implementation of the National Development Plan</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2015">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">New National Development Plan (2015-2018 -- implementation beginning 1 Sept 2015)</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 Provide Support to the Approval process of KNDP 2020-2025, and produce awareness raising materials for Media Campaign.
1.2 Finalize Household Income and Expenditures Survey</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 Communication package and materials for KNDP 2020-2021 was finalized, training for Development Projects Management Teams was conducted.
1.2 Household Income and Expenditures Survey suspended due to COVID-19, new methodology for resumption of the survey in 2021 was agreed.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 Provide support to the implementation of National Roadmap for the enhancement of Kuwait Sovereign Credit Rating.
1.2 Finalize Household Income and Expenditures Survey</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 EY, the implementing partner, has submitted all the deliverables of the National Roadmap for the enhancement of Kuwait Sovereign Credit Rating. The final report is to be approved in September 2021 by the government, to release the final payment. 

1.2 The household Income and Expenditures Survey is progressing on time as planned. The final report to be received by early December. 

The whole project will be closed financially and operationally in December 2021.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
